<title>HONG KONG: Union Bank of Bangkok sets $20 mln sub FRN.</title>
<headline>Union Bank of Bangkok sets $20 mln sub FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating rate note issue was announced by arranger KDB Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER  UNION BANK OF BANGKOK PCL</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$20 MLN    COUPON     6ML+150 BP MATURITY  5 1/2YRS</p>
<p> TYPE  SUBORDINATED FRN ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH  31.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	   CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES 15.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	   REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATING    ---	    SALE LMTS  THAI/HK/US CUSTOMARY</p>
<p> HOME CTRY THAILAND     GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE  --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MGRS  US$4-5 MLN  96.25 BP    ALL-IN 202.5</p>
<p>	     MANAGERS	US$2-3 MLN  82.5  BP    ALL-IN 200 BP</p>
<p>(ALL-IN RETURN INCLUDES AN ANNUAL FACILITY FEE OF 35 BP PAYABLE</p>
<p>ANNUALLY ON EACH INTEREST PAYMENT DATE)</p>
<p>ARRANGERS KDB ASIA AND PEREGRINE FIXED INCOME</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
